title: Pam_Intro
---
<<set_left CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<set_right CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: <b>OH MY GOD ITS PAMELLA</b>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: Yeah?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: look at that <i>dress</i>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: uhuh?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: look at her <i>hair</i>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: ok?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: I need it Cine
Fran: I have to look as cool as she does and figure out her <i>fasion secrets</i>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: then how about you try talking to her?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: <b>GENIUS!</b>
<<set_left CharacterManager Pamella>>
<<wait .15>>
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: hey Pamella
Pamella seems to be in the middle of a heated phone call about some sort of "fashion emergency"
Francine: Pamella?
She barks at the person on the phone before hanging up
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Pamella: I swear some people simply don't understand. this is absolutely <i>tragic</i> Francine
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: What is?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Pamella: Oh. Dear. Let me tell you <b>ALL</b> about it.
<<beginning CharacterManager Pamella>>
===
